    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d92">

                <pb facs="0185" n="173" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg173"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 EAC/126</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by President Roosevelt to the Acting Secretary of
                            State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-02-18">February 18,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>What are the zones in the British and Russian drafts and what is the zone we are
                    proposing? I must know this in order that it conform with what I decided on
                    months ago.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>F[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ranklin</hi>] D. R[<hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">oosevelt</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
